<title>HONG KONG: Hutchison says Lee resigns as director.</title>
<headline>Hutchison says Lee resigns as director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchison Whampoa Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday Charles Lee resigned as director on March 12 to devote himself to his public duties.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
